ent against  the  gene ratio on the x-axis  so  we see the different pathways like the  cell junction assembly the sodium ion  transport skin development positive  regulation of the  cell junction assembly so these are the  top 20 pathways that were present and  the red dot signifies that it's having a  higher level of expression and the dot  value basically shows  or the circle would show that  how many number of genes are present for  example if i talk about the cell  junction assembly we can see it would be  having around eight genes and its  pre-adjusted value  is  nearly about point zero three point zero  two and it is highly differentially  expressed  so  this was the type of interpretation that  would be  that we would be getting from  these graphs and  next  what i would be doing  uh is basically taking the genes  that are quite highly expressed in the  melanoma cells and then i'll be  comparing it with the fairer and darker  skin to see whether those genes that are  involved in the melanoma or the melanoma  pathway are  highly expressed or  you know highly  present in the darker skin or lighter  skin and then i'll be concluding with my  work  stating that these genes have this much  level of expression in the darker skin  and this much in the lighter skin  obviously those genes would be having if  if a person has melanoma and definitely  those genes would be the genes that  would be present in a less quantity in  the darker skin and  probably in more quantity  in the lighter scale but when i'll do  that analysis that would be the  end of my work and  then i'll be concluding my work  thank you i hope you understood this  presentation and the work i did till now  and i'll be continuing it further  thank you
 

